    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BananaStep&quot; is an simple action game that you are banana and blow away monkeys. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lifting exhilarating action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By punching the monkey and lifting it, you will be able to send it flying.<br>Keep defeating them and aim for the boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lifting Combo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By repeating lifting without dropping, you will feel comfortable and increase your score.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BananaStep&quot; is an simple action game that you are banana and blow away monkeys. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lifting exhilarating action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By punching the monkey and lifting it, you will be able to send it flying.<br>Keep defeating them and aim for the boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lifting Combo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By repeating lifting without dropping, you will feel comfortable and increase your score.</p>",
